    "detailed_description": "<strong>ZendoVR is a walking meditation in the woods.</strong><br>The player is led along a set path in the woods and around some ponds for about 32 minutes. <br>At intervals the walking stops and a though about meditation is presented.<br><br>One can stop (down arrow key) any time and just sit and meditate.  Find your favorite place.<br><br>You can control time of day, music, sounds, dialog, walking speed, and graphics detail.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441690/extras/83443841344412d77507833e8fd1598d.avif?t=1605545267\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441690/extras/ec6624fd56fbb7d2f3484571b2896ecc.avif?t=1605545267\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why</h2>I wrote ZendoVR in 2016 as an idea I had for VR and meditation. It is what I wanted in a VR experience.<br>I hope you all enjoy it as much as I do.<br><br>Many thanks to Gil Fronsdale. I am a follower though we have never met.",
